@host = http://localhost:5028

# The ticket bodies live in TestTickets/ (also used by the Swagger examples and the ticket eval)

### A: explained by the billing change of 2026-10-19 (component given)
POST {{host}}/analyze-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

< ./TestTickets/ticket-a.json

### B: matches no change (component given)
POST {{host}}/analyze-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

< ./TestTickets/ticket-b.json

### C: explained by the invoices change of 2026-10-21 (no component)
POST {{host}}/analyze-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

< ./TestTickets/ticket-c.json

### D: vague ticket, the component's changes don't explain it (component given)
POST {{host}}/analyze-ticket
Content-Type: application/json

< ./TestTickets/ticket-d.json
